      </ul>
      <span class="tag tag-yellow">📈 Пассивный доход</span>
    </div>

    <!-- CARD 4 -->
    <div class="card card-4">
      <span class="card-num">04</span>
      <span class="card-icon">🎯</span>
      <h3>CPA-сети —<br><span class="highlight-pink">оплата за действие</span></h3>
